  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Follow evidence",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Missing signal",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Use an exact **Event ID** for one observation or **Request / trace ID** for correlated records. Open a log record for timestamps, source, outcome and integrity hash. Resource filters apply to infrastructure; team, participant and application filters apply to application records. Infrastructure, application telemetry, platform audit and competition records retain their own contracts. An observation does not establish a scoring result."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Matching infrastructure observations",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 4
      },
      "description": "Count of matching infrastructure telemetry records. Exact event IDs are stable evidence references.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No matching events",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({record_family=\"infrastructure_telemetry\",environment=~\"${environment:regex}\",resource_id=~\"${resource:regex}\"} | json event_id=\"event_id\", request_id=\"request_id\", trace_id=\"trace_id\" | __error__=\"\" | label_format event_filter=${event_id:doublequote}, correlation_filter=${correlation:doublequote} | (event_filter=\"\" or event_id=${event_id:doublequote}) | (correlation_filter=\"\" or request_id=${correlation:doublequote} or trace_id=${correlation:doublequote}) | keep source [$__range]))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{resource_id}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "queryType": "instant",
          "maxLines": 200,
          "direction": "backward",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Matching application observations",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 4
      },
      "description": "Count of matching application telemetry records; preserves canonical application scope.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No matching events",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({namespace=~\"jengasec-ent-(a|b)-app0[1-9]\",enterprise=~\"${enterprise:regex}\",application=~\"${application:regex}\"} | json actor_team_id=\"actor.team_id\", actor_participant_id=\"actor.participant_id\", event_id=\"event_id\", request_id=\"request_id\", trace_id=\"trace_id\" | __error__=\"\" | label_format observation_environment=`{{ if .environment }}{{ .environment }}{{ else }}unclassified{{ end }}` | observation_environment=~\"${environment:regex}\" | label_format team_filter=${team:doublequote}, participant_filter=${participant:doublequote}, event_filter=${event_id:doublequote}, correlation_filter=${correlation:doublequote} | (team_filter=\"\" or actor_team_id=${team:doublequote}) | (participant_filter=\"\" or actor_participant_id=${participant:doublequote}) | (event_filter=\"\" or event_id=${event_id:doublequote}) | (correlation_filter=\"\" or request_id=${correlation:doublequote} or trace_id=${correlation:doublequote}) | keep source [$__range]))",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{resource_id}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "queryType": "instant",
          "maxLines": 200,
          "direction": "backward",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Infrastructure evidence",
      "type": "logs",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 13
      },
      "description": "Staff-only infrastructure records. Expand each record to inspect its integrity hash and event time.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No matching events",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{record_family=\"infrastructure_telemetry\",environment=~\"${environment:regex}\",resource_id=~\"${resource:regex}\"} | json event_id=\"event_id\", request_id=\"request_id\", trace_id=\"trace_id\" | __error__=\"\" | label_format event_filter=${event_id:doublequote}, correlation_filter=${correlation:doublequote} | (event_filter=\"\" or event_id=${event_id:doublequote}) | (correlation_filter=\"\" or request_id=${correlation:doublequote} or trace_id=${correlation:doublequote}) | json",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{resource_id}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "queryType": "range",
          "maxLines": 200,
          "direction": "backward",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Application evidence",
      "type": "logs",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 13
      },
      "description": "Canonical application observations including exact request and trace correlation. No identity is guessed for unattributed events.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No matching events",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{namespace=~\"jengasec-ent-(a|b)-app0[1-9]\",enterprise=~\"${enterprise:regex}\",application=~\"${application:regex}\"} | json actor_team_id=\"actor.team_id\", actor_participant_id=\"actor.participant_id\", event_id=\"event_id\", request_id=\"request_id\", trace_id=\"trace_id\" | __error__=\"\" | label_format observation_environment=`{{ if .environment }}{{ .environment }}{{ else }}unclassified{{ end }}` | observation_environment=~\"${environment:regex}\" | label_format team_filter=${team:doublequote}, participant_filter=${participant:doublequote}, event_filter=${event_id:doublequote}, correlation_filter=${correlation:doublequote} | (team_filter=\"\" or actor_team_id=${team:doublequote}) | (participant_filter=\"\" or actor_participant_id=${participant:doublequote}) | (event_filter=\"\" or event_id=${event_id:doublequote}) | (correlation_filter=\"\" or request_id=${correlation:doublequote} or trace_id=${correlation:doublequote}) | json",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "legendFormat": "{{resource_id}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "queryType": "range",
          "maxLines": 200,
          "direction": "backward",
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Evidence availability",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 35,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "Missing signal",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Search uses the retained telemetry window. Missing cited IDs require investigation before an evidence export is accepted. Platform audit and competition evidence are supplied separately by their owners; a blank telemetry query does not mean that no platform action, signup, finding or score exists."
      }
    }
  ]
